[{"id":184623122,"discussion_id":"6f79805b81275ffc0771ae3955677eeb7b04d876","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本 PR 修改了 `mc2/allto_allv_quant_grouped_mat_mul/op_kernel/mc2_templates/scheduler/a2av_gmm_scheduler.h` 中 AIC barrier 同步的等待标志：将 `AscendC::CrossCoreWaitFlag` 的模板参数从 `PIPE_FIX` 调整为 `PIPE_S`，以修正等待侧使用的流水线标志，而设置侧的 `CrossCoreSetFlag` 仍保持 `PIPE_FIX` 不变。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **AIC barrier 等待标志修正**：在 `a2av_gmm_scheduler.h` 中，将 `AscendC::CrossCoreWaitFlag<SYNC_MODE_AIC_BARRIER, ...>` 的第二个模板参数由 `PIPE_FIX` 改为 `PIPE_S`，用于调整跨核 AIC barrier 等待的流水线同步标志。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-13T15:18:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-13T15:24:37+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":184623156,"discussion_id":"6cf36d810ae9a1d332a4e38ce359743fb05bab77","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| mc2 | ✅ [*captainmiaow*](https://gitcode.com/captainmiaow), [*tgwsakiko_*](https://gitcode.com/tgwsakiko_) (2/2) | ✅ [*captainmiaow*](https://gitcode.com/captainmiaow) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/ap